{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029501001:1":{"text":"你们从那个方向过来，难道说……你们真的去月神遗殿聆听神启了吗？","source_cn":"你们从那个方向过来，难道说……你们真的去月神遗殿聆听神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB74FA233EA73279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029501002:1":{"text":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","source_cn":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD524066E248CBC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","female":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","variant_male_record_index":"115425","variant_female_record_index":"115426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029501003:1":{"text":"你也太莽撞了，我还没有做完这个传说的考证……","source_cn":"你也太莽撞了，我还没有做完这个传说的考证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46EAA7200264528D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029501004:1":{"text":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029501004":{"text":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title"